[38;2;124;124;124m2^{2^j} ≡ -1 (mod p) since p = 2^{2^j}+1. So 2^a ≡ -1 (mod p) when a ≡ 2^j (mod [0m[38;2;124;124;124m2^{j+1}). Then k·2^a ≡ k·(-1) ≡ -1 (mod p) requires k ≡ 1 (mod p).[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mSo if k ≡ 1 (mod p) for each Fermat prime p used, then for n ≡ 2^j (mod [0m
