[38;2;124;124;124mThe covering: n ≡ 2^j (mod 2^{j+1}) for j = 0,1,2,... These cover all n ≥ 0? n ≡[0m[38;2;124;124;124m1 (mod 2) [j=0: 2^0=1, mod 2], n ≡ 2 (mod 4) [j=1], n ≡ 4 (mod 8) [j=2], n ≡ 8 [0m
